%% 客户端合同真源: /System/Volumes/Data/workspace/angular/visual/cses-client/specs/003-messagev3-gate-inventory/gates/pin/mv3-g05h/contract.json
%% UI owners: src/pages/message-v3/service/dialogSwitch.service.ts::loadTopMessages；src/pages/message-v3/service/messageGlobalBaseContext.service.ts::loadDialogData（置顶为必须加载项，不缓存）
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant UI as Angular UI
  participant Gate as MessageV3 Gate Port
  participant Native as Tauri Native
  participant FFI as Flutter FFI
  participant Web as Browser Web
  participant E as ExecutionShell Tick
  participant IM as helix-im
  participant Host as driver-host
  participant DB as tenant SQLite
  participant Go as Go IM Server
  participant WS as WS inbound
  participant Sink as EventSink raw bytes
  Note over UI,Gate: 用户目标：成员切进会话即看到顶部置顶条；点开置顶抽屉能看到全部置顶消息
  Note over UI,Web: 当前覆盖状态：mock=implemented；helix=partial；dual=yes；personaLocal=yes；该图是交互合同，不把 Mock、HTTP 2xx 或静态注册写成真实 Green
  alt PC Tauri 入口
    UI->>Gate: getPinnedPosts(payload)
    Gate->>Native: invokeAccepted("im_channel_load_post_pinned", payload)
    Native->>E: Tick::Command(AppCommand)
  else Flutter FFI 入口
    FFI->>E: helix_command("im_channel_load_post_pinned", payload)
  else Browser Web 入口
    Web->>E: invoke("im_channel_load_post_pinned", payload)
  end
  E->>IM: ExecutionShell::step(Tick::Command)
  IM->>IM: 校验 读回会话的全部置顶消息 的入参，生成 corr_key/req_id
  IM->>Host: Effect::Http POST /channel/load/postPinned
  Host->>Go: HTTP request with tenant/auth/corr headers
  Go-->>Host: HTTP response（2xx 只代表 admission/query response）
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply(http)
  E->>IM: correlate req_id/corr_key
  IM-->>E: Command Result {data}
  E-->>Gate: PortReply(Result)
  Gate-->>UI: render absolute snapshot or query result
  alt HTTP / PortReply / Persist error
    IM->>IM: keep prior durable state；attach structured error to corr_key
    IM-->>E: Err or correlated error result
    E-->>Gate: controlled failure
    Gate-->>UI: error / empty state；不得伪造成功事件
  end
  Note over IM,DB: 关键效果：返回 post, operator[]：operator 是该条置顶动作 actor 的 currentUserId，来自持久化 post_pinned.pinned_by；顺序 = 置顶集合插入序；集合为空或频道未知时返回 []（graceful，不抛错）；不同成员查询同一频道时，同一 postId 返回完全相同的 operator actor userId；纯读取不改置顶集合、消息 props.pinned，且 events 为 []
  Note over UI,Web: 关键负向：纯读取不得 emit 任何出站事件：本次调用期间 events 长度恒为 0；置顶集合里查不到消息的 postId 必须跳过，禁止把 undefined 塞进返回数组（spread 前 filter undefined 雷区）
  Note over E,Sink: 出站事件集合：无业务事件；跨端只搬运 {event,data} 原始字节，不在 shell 复制 reducer
